  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#navigate and https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#unload-a-document\n\nIn particular, the spec should clarifies if fragment navigations, javascript: navigations and other types of navigations are allowed in the unload handlers. Also, if history manipulation via pushState is allowed or not. Different browsers behave differently with respect to that.\n",
